flowchart TD
    A[Governed command received] --> B[Resolve identity, action and resource]
    B --> C{Governance context complete?}
    C -- No --> X[Deny and audit]
    C -- Yes --> D[Load policies and authority grants]
    D --> E[Classify risk]
    E --> F{Policy conflict or explicit deny?}
    F -- Yes --> X
    F -- No --> G{Approval required?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Create approval request]
    H --> I{Quorum, sequence and segregation satisfied?}
    I -- No --> J[Wait, reject or expire]
    J --> X
    I -- Yes --> K{Financial commitment?}
    G -- No --> K
    K -- Yes --> L[Reserve budget]
    L --> M{Reservation valid?}
    M -- No --> X
    M -- Yes --> N[Issue time-bound decision token]
    K -- No --> N
    N --> O[Execute governed action]
    O --> P[Reconcile outcome and budget]
    P --> Q[Append immutable audit evidence]
    Q --> R[Publish governance outcome events]
